  "description": "Support me post more free and better models by [Patreon](https://www.patreon.com/chambersu)\n\nI am also doing 3D modeling commissions, and please contact me by chambersu1996@gmail.com for more information~\n\nDemo Version of:https://skfb.ly/6OKHZ\n\nPlease purchase full version for supporting and helping me work further and better~\n\nFull Version Including An HD version (1.2M Tris & 2K Seamless PBR Tex) and A low-poly version(18K Tris with 8K Baked Tex) for game engines.\n\nThere are a Blender(2.80) file and FBX files.  Please Contact me by emails (chambersu1996@gmail.com) or comments for different LOD, format or support If needing~\n\nI try to create one of my Dream mounts. I learn a lot about real motorcycles during designing and building it. Have Fun!\n\nIf I can afford a real motorcycle, I will go further about it. It seems some details are not able to be told by only pictures or words. I have to touch them someday.\n\nBlender-EEVEE:\n![](https://www.chambersu.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/SZH2I2EEVEE1080.png)",
